		{
			"identifier": "CameraCenterHere",
			"uid": 125,
			"tags": [],
			"exportToToc": false,
			"allowOutOfBounds": false,
			"doc": "If inside a CameraLockedBound, then this is where the camera will center to. If not in one, then it is ignored. If multiple in one bound, then the one closest to the player will be chosen. If this is in one camerabound and a player is in a different one, then it will be ignored even if the player is closer",
